    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate, care for and protect Andalusian patios in this relaxed strategy game with a lot of heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udeb4 Water the plants by solving chain water droplet mini-games. The better you do, the prettier your plant will look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Decorate your yard with painted plates, stamps, flower pots, sentimental objects and many more surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Solve environmental puzzles to improve every corner and unlock new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc26 Explore unique courtyards full of life, secrets and characters with stories to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc75 Talk to your grandmother Julia and other endearing characters who will guide you and make you laugh... or despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet game with sparkle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each patio is a small world that reflects the culture and soul of Andalusia. From humble patios to more stately ones, your mission will be to take care of them with love, creativity and strategy. Ideal for those looking for something beautiful, relaxed and with touches of humor and social criticism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Compatible with keyboard, mouse and gamepad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Available in Spanish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc77 Demo in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Colorful artistic style, inspired by Andalusian folklore and popular aesthetics.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate, care for and protect Andalusian patios in this relaxed strategy game with a lot of heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udeb4 Water the plants by solving chain water droplet mini-games. The better you do, the prettier your plant will look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Decorate your yard with painted plates, stamps, flower pots, sentimental objects and many more surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Solve environmental puzzles to improve every corner and unlock new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc26 Explore unique courtyards full of life, secrets and characters with stories to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc75 Talk to your grandmother Julia and other endearing characters who will guide you and make you laugh... or despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet game with sparkle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each patio is a small world that reflects the culture and soul of Andalusia. From humble patios to more stately ones, your mission will be to take care of them with love, creativity and strategy. Ideal for those looking for something beautiful, relaxed and with touches of humor and social criticism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Compatible with keyboard, mouse and gamepad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Available in Spanish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc77 Demo in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Colorful artistic style, inspired by Andalusian folklore and popular aesthetics.</p>",
    "short_description": "Enter the world of Teo, a young girl who returns to her neighborhood to help her grandmother Julia prepare for the traditional courtyard contest. What seemed like a quiet job of watering and decorating soon becomes complicated with mysterious real estate plots and neighbors with a lot to tell.",
